{
  "id": "astral-radiance-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Astral Radiance Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Shops in the Prerelease Program could hold unofficial Astral Radiance prerelease tournaments, on the weekends of 14–15 and 21–22 May 2022, and sell the boxes from 14 May. Each box held four Astral Radiance booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Astral Radiance logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Keldeo, Wyrdeer, Absol, Hisuian Samurott, Magnezone, Adaman and Irida, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and Brilliant Stars' non-holo Professor's Research again.",
